{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Roost Home 是一個私密的家庭生活中樞，把家務、三餐餐單、每日習慣與行程約會集中於同一處，適合希望與家人分工清晰、又不想把家居私隱放上社交平台的用戶。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-98.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>家務餐單習慣集中管理</h2>\n<p>分派家務並設定重複清單，完成後直接勾選；三餐可預先排好，免去每晚互相詢問。每日習慣記錄連續日數，運動、閱讀或喝水一目瞭然。事件可設定時間、地點與提前提醒，週或月檢視把家務、餐單、習慣與行程集合於同一畫面。所有資料只存本機，沒有動態消息與廣告。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-337-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-338-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-339-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-340-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-341-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Roost Home</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/roost-home/id6762004078?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T19:40:36.827238+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":280,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T19:35:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T09:59:01.770424+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T19:38:23.641335+00:00","content_hash":"9846b91b5f0c03fc5d2ec6f191a6072493e1fe7cecc0973103274604226fcdb6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}